  "description": "Operating Area: Turkey\n\nAngels is a stunning Arcadia A105 motor yacht, delivered in 2025, offering a unique blend of contemporary design, exceptional comfort and seamless indoor-outdoor living. With six guest cabins and a professional crew of six, she provides an ideal setting for families and groups seeking a sophisticated and effortless Mediterranean charter experience. Designed around a close connection with the sea, Angels features expansive living areas, large opening windows and a versatile **65 sqm sky lounge and sun lounge**, creating an exceptional space for relaxing, dining and enjoying the outdoors. Her wide beam, natural light, generous volumes and solar-panel technology reflect Arcadia’s distinctive approach to comfort and efficiency, while her elegant design and attentive crew ensure an unforgettable experience cruising the Mediterranean.",
